                                "sense_id": "c0082924-121f-36df-b0ed-d2794a17b64c",
                                "text": "A third oil company, Gulf, is soon to join Esso and BP in rail forwardings from this port."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfd686da-a379-4f9a-b06d-9396ad582656",
                                "sense_id": "c0082924-121f-36df-b0ed-d2794a17b64c",
                                "text": "You might think that the GatewayPorts feature discussed in the last section applies equally well to remote port forwardings. This would make sense as a feature, but as it happens, it isn't done."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
